on, or a long-horizon land position — and on how much of your capital you can leave untouched."}]]}]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"shell pb-4","data-reveal":true,"children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","alt":"Plot or apartment in Bangalore? — Bengaluru property","width":1600,"height":686,"className":"aspect-[21/9] w-full object-cover"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 max-w-[70ch] text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-soft)]","children":"Images are representational or supplied by the developer. This guide explains paperwork, not a specific unit."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-[var(--sheet)] text-[var(--sheet-ink)]","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell page-section grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16","children":[["$","aside",null,{"className":"hidden lg:col-span-3 lg:block","children":["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"On this page","className":"sticky top-28","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[14px] text-[var(--sheet-soft)]","children":"On this page"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-[15px]","children":[["$","li","The comparison that actually decides it",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#the-comparison-that-actually-decides-it","className":"text-[var(--sheet-ink)] underline decoration-transparent underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-[var(--gold-on-light)]","children":"The comparison that actually decides it"}]}],["$","li","Cash flow is the first filter",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#cash-flow-is-the-first-filter","className":"text-[var(--sheet-ink)] underline decoration-transparent underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-[var(--gold-on-light)]","children":"Cash flow is the first filter"}]}],["$","li","Appreciation is a corridor question, not a category question",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#appreciation-is-a-corridor-question-not-a-category-question","className":"text